    "short_description": "The Battle of Brides is over, the kingdom lies in ruins. The corrupt rule, the just die or flee. As one of the defeated, forge your path of vengeance: Master warfare, claim and manage camps, villages, strongholds, become a noble, rebel - live through a dark medieval story in an open-world RPG.",
